{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Put on Your Thinking Cap</h2>Each level is designed as a short puzzle: how do you go about acquiring your powers and then how do you use them to reach the goal? <br>Powers are always reset at the beginning of a level, and not all of them are always available, so each level has you working in a new way.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six Powers</h2>Jump, dash, pound, shoot lasers, turn invisible (and invulnerable), and slow down objects to achieve victory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single Player or Co-op</h2>There are 20 one-player levels, and 20 more two-player levels, for approximately 5 hours of gameplay.<br>In co-op, you get just as many powers as in single player, so you have to share these powers between yourselves in order to reach the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Own Disq</h2>Players can choose between eight colours and eight accessories to customise their character, an amicable individual named Disq.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Precision Is Key</h2>You can plan your way through a stage, or figure it out through trial and error. Either way, hitting a hazard resets the level. This game is best played by people who are patient and dedicated to success!<br>A practice stage is available if you want to work on a particular motion in a safe environment.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One.One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2069160/0b3c6052d84b4bc5b98e620d61b3ad5f47723058.jpg"},{"name":"One.Two","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2069160/75ec8562cf53f57a9caeea84085c7d2fc6ecc925.jpg"},{"name":"One.Three","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2069160/b29995cb86b2d9d780cfbb617ab71018fd1b7a81.jpg"},{"name":"One.Four","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2069160/e54b75afb62754db8c9c15491e0f900649b50e30.jpg"},{"name":"One.Five","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamc